{"seq":2,"slug":"agreement-tariff-schedule-duty-calculation","title":"协定税率表建模与关税计算引擎（MFN vs 优惠、从价/从量/复合税）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/fta-preference-utilization-duty-savings-engineering/preference-regime-comparison-duty-model/agreement-tariff-schedule-duty-calculation","wordCount":2616,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"协定税率表建模与关税计算引擎-mfn-vs-优惠-从价-从量-复合税\">协定税率表建模与关税计算引擎（MFN vs 优惠、从价/从量/复合税）</h1><p>打开美国 HTS 的任意一行，三个互不相同的税率并列写着：General 栏 <code>4.7%</code>、Special 栏 <code>Free (A*, B, C, ...)</code>、Column 2 栏 <code>45%</code>；再往下某个农产品是 <code>2.5¢/kg</code>——没有百分号；再下一行是 <code>4.4% + 1.1¢/kg</code>。<strong>税率在数据层面从来不是一个浮点数，而是一个可求值的表达式</strong>：它要三样输入（完税价格、数量、原产国/协定资格），输出一个金额。把这三栏、这三条算式、以及它们叠加的先后顺序建成可计算的模型，就是本文要处理的工程问题。</p>\n<p>本文与同章的 <a href=\"multi-fta-preference-regime-taxonomy\">多 FTA 优惠制度图谱与适用条件矩阵</a>、<a href=\"regime-selection-best-rate-sourcing\">协定择优决策与最优税率申报路径</a> 构成一组：那两篇讲<strong>有哪些制度、该选哪条路</strong>，本文讲<strong>选定之后这个数怎么算出来</strong>。资格判定属于 <a href=\"../sku-origin-qualification-engine/\">SKU 原产地资格引擎</a> 的范围，本文只把它当作一个布尔输入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-税率是表达式-完税价格是它的基底\">核心概念：税率是表达式，完税价格是它的基底</h2><p>各国税率表都是<strong>层级化的商品编码树</strong>（HS 6 位国际层 + 各国扩展位），每个叶子节点挂着一组<strong>措施（measure）</strong>——「适用国家/集团 + 法律依据 + 税率表达式」的三元组。这套结构由世界海关组织的《商品名称及编码协调制度》（HS）统辖：HS 用 6 位编码把商品划分为 5000 多个商品组，被 200 多个国家/地区采用，每 5–6 年修订一次，当前通用版本为 HS 2022（来源：<a href=\"https://www.wcoomd.org/en/topics/nomenclature/overview/what-is-the-harmonized-system.aspx\">WCO 关于 HS 的说明</a>）。美国的 10 位 HTS、欧盟的 10 位 TARIC、中国的 13 位编码，都在此之上挂接本国税率与监管措施。</p>\n<p>税率表达式的形态由关税法定义，主流四种：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>v</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>r</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{ad\\ valorem} = V \\times r, \\qquad D_{specific} = Q \\times s, \\qquad D_{compound} = V \\times r + Q \\times s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ec</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 是完税价格，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 是从价税率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 是<strong>计量数量</strong>（千克、升、平方米、件），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 是从量税额；第四种 <code>Free</code>（零税率）是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 的退化表达式。从价与从量的组合叫<strong>复合税（compound duty）</strong>（来源：<a href=\"https://hts.usitc.gov/\">USITC HTS</a>、<a href=\"https://taxation-customs.ec.europa.eu/customs-4/calculation-customs-duties_en\">欧盟关税计算</a>）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[商品编码节点&lt;br/&gt;HS6 + 国别扩展位] --&gt; B[措施集合]&#10;  B --&gt; C{适用对象}&#10;  C --&gt;|所有 WTO 成员| D[General / MFN&lt;br/&gt;默认基线税率]&#10;  C --&gt;|特定协定/受惠国| E[Special / 优惠栏&lt;br/&gt;需资格证明]&#10;  C --&gt;|无正常贸易关系| F[Column 2&lt;br/&gt;高额法定税率]&#10;  D --&gt; G[税率表达式]&#10;  E --&gt; G&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; H{表达式类型}&#10;  H --&gt; I[从价税]&#10;  H --&gt; J[从量税]&#10;  H --&gt; K[复合税]&#10;  H --&gt; L[Free 零税率]\">graph TD\n  A[商品编码节点&lt;br/&gt;HS6 + 国别扩展位] --&gt; B[措施集合]\n  B --&gt; C{适用对象}\n  C --&gt;|所有 WTO 成员| D[General / MFN&lt;br/&gt;默认基线税率]\n  C --&gt;|特定协定/受惠国| E[Special / 优惠栏&lt;br/&gt;需资格证明]\n  C --&gt;|无正常贸易关系| F[Column 2&lt;br/&gt;高额法定税率]\n  D --&gt; G[税率表达式]\n  E --&gt; G\n  F --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; H{表达式类型}\n  H --&gt; I[从价税]\n  H --&gt; J[从量税]\n  H --&gt; K[复合税]\n  H --&gt; L[Free 零税率]</pre><p>关键结构点：<strong>General（MFN）栏是基线，Special 栏只是在基线之上按资格覆盖的一张折扣层</strong>。美国 HTS 用字母符号（<code>A*</code>、<code>B</code>、<code>C</code>、<code>S</code> 等）标记每个 Special 税率对应哪个协定或受惠计划，资格条件写在税率表前置的 General Notes 里；只有满足通则全部条件，Special 栏税率才生效，否则回落 General 栏（来源：<a href=\"https://hts.usitc.gov/\">USITC HTS</a>、<a href=\"https://usmca.com/\">USMCA 关税待遇说明</a>）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>税率类型</th>\n<th>表达式</th>\n<th>需要的输入</th>\n<th>典型品类</th>\n<th>工程含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>从价税</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V \\times r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>完税价格</td>\n<td>电子、服装、家具</td>\n<td>只需价格字段，最常见</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>从量税</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q \\times s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>计量数量 + 单位</td>\n<td>酒类、烟草、食糖</td>\n<td>必须采集并归一化计量单位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复合税</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V \\times r + Q \\times s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>价格 + 数量</td>\n<td>部分纺织品、糖制品</td>\n<td>两部分独立计算后相加</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Free / 优惠 0%</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>资格证明</td>\n<td>多数协定降税终点</td>\n<td>表达式为 0，但资格仍要存证</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"从完税价格到应缴税额-一条完整的计算链\">从完税价格到应缴税额：一条完整的计算链</h2><p>计算引擎的第一性问题不是「乘哪个税率」，而是**「乘在什么数上」<strong>。关税法的起点是</strong>完税价格（customs value）<strong>，它不是发票金额的同义词。以欧盟《联盟海关法典》（UCC，Regulation (EU) 952/2013）为例，海关估价规定在第 69–76 条，按顺序提供六种方法：<strong>成交价格法</strong>（第 70 条，主方法）→ 相同货物成交价格 → 类似货物成交价格 → 扣减法 → 计算法 → 合理回推法，并规定应加计项目（第 71 条，佣金、包装、特许权使用费等）与应扣除项目（第 72 条）（来源：<a href=\"https://taxation-customs.ec.europa.eu/customs-4/calculation-customs-duties_en\">欧盟委员会·海关估价</a>）。引擎因此不能直接把订单金额当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span>，而必须先做一套</strong>加计/扣除调整**，且口径因法域而异。</p>\n<p>一票申报的税额是各适用措施与叠加层的合计：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>applicable</mtext></mrow></munder><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>additional</mtext></mrow></munder><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{total} = \\sum_{m \\in \\text{applicable}} D_m + \\sum_{k \\in \\text{additional}} D_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4882em;vertical-align:-1.4382em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">applicable</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4382em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3795em;vertical-align:-1.3295em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">additional</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3295em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>第一项是<strong>同层措施的合计</strong>（如从价与从量部分），第二项是<strong>叠加在关税层之上的附加税</strong>。工程陷阱是：附加税并不总是「在优惠后的基础上再乘」。以美国为例，正当关税可能还要叠加 Chapter 99 项下的附加措施（如 232 关税、301 关税、IEEPA 类对等关税），HTS 通过 Chapter 99 注释把「某类最惠国/协定资格货物是否仍受附加税约束」写成条件；USMCA 场景下即使 Special 栏写着 Free，Chapter 99 第 51(a) 号注释仍可能使加拿大产货物继续承担 Section 338 附加税（来源：<a href=\"https://usmca.com/\">USMCA 关税待遇说明</a>）。因此<strong>正确顺序是「先算基线层，再逐层叠加，优惠只作用于它被授权作用的层」</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[申报数据] --&gt; B[完税价格 V&lt;br/&gt;成交价 + 加计 - 扣除]&#10;  A --&gt; C[归一化数量 Q]&#10;  B --&gt; D[匹配适用措施&lt;br/&gt;按原产国 + 资格证明]&#10;  C --&gt; D&#10;  D --&gt; E[求值税率表达式]&#10;  E --&gt; F[叠加附加措施&lt;br/&gt;按 Chapter 99 注释判断]&#10;  F --&gt; G[按法定汇率时点换算 + 舍入]&#10;  G --&gt; H[得出应缴税额]\">graph TD\n  A[申报数据] --&gt; B[完税价格 V&lt;br/&gt;成交价 + 加计 - 扣除]\n  A --&gt; C[归一化数量 Q]\n  B --&gt; D[匹配适用措施&lt;br/&gt;按原产国 + 资格证明]\n  C --&gt; D\n  D --&gt; E[求值税率表达式]\n  E --&gt; F[叠加附加措施&lt;br/&gt;按 Chapter 99 注释判断]\n  F --&gt; G[按法定汇率时点换算 + 舍入]\n  G --&gt; H[得出应缴税额]</pre><h2 id=\"税率表的层级数据模型-列-措施与配额\">税率表的层级数据模型：列、措施与配额</h2><p>要把上面这条链跑通，税率必须以<strong>结构化数据</strong>而非 PDF 存在系统里，抽象为四层：<strong>商品编码 → 措施 → 税率表达式 → 生效条件</strong>。英国贸易关税 API 是一个可直接对照的公开实现：以 OAuth 2.0 <code>client_credentials</code> 鉴权，可查询商品编码、关税与增值税率、是否有减免或优惠税率、是否需要进口许可，以及按商品/年份/地理区域查询<strong>配额措施</strong>（来源：<a href=\"https://docs.trade-tariff.service.gov.uk/\">英国贸易关税 API 文档</a>）。<strong>税率查询正在从「人查网页」变成「系统按调用契约取数」。</strong></p>\n<p>欧盟侧对应结构是 TARIC：为每个商品编码挂接第三国税率（erga omnes）、协定优惠税率、反倾销与配额监控措施，配 <strong>additional code（附加码）</strong> 区分同一编码下的政策差异；门户 Access2Markets 把「税率 + 原产地规则 + 单证要求」合并到一次查询（来源：<a href=\"https://trade.ec.europa.eu/access-to-markets/en/home\">欧盟 Access2Markets</a>）。配额允许<strong>限量货物按降低的税率进口</strong>（来源：<a href=\"https://taxation-customs.ec.europa.eu/customs-4/calculation-customs-duties_en\">欧盟委员会·关税与配额</a>），同一编码因此会同时存在<strong>配额内</strong>与<strong>配额外</strong>两条并行表达式，需按订单号与剩余额度实时选路。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从量税与复合税的工程难点-单位-汇率与时点\">从量税与复合税的工程难点：单位、汇率与时点</h2><p>从价税只需一个价格字段，<strong>从量税和复合税却把「数量」变成了和「价格」同等重要的输入</strong>，这是计算引擎最容易出错的地方。难点有三处：<strong>计量单位</strong>——从量税率绑定的法定单位可能是千克、净重/毛重、升、百升、平方米、立方米或「件/双」，实际申报单位（如「箱」）必须先按包装规格换算，错一步税额就成比例错；<strong>货币</strong>——从量税的表达币种可能与结算币种不同，须按法域规定的汇率适用日期（通常为报关受理日或前一日）换算，而非订单汇率；<strong>舍入</strong>——税额、单价、汇率各自可能按法域规则舍入，且先后顺序会影响结果，必须固化在引擎里。下面这段代码说明了三者的位置：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ts\" data-code=\"type RateComponent = { kind: &#39;ad_valorem&#39;; rate: number } | { kind: &#39;specific&#39;; amount: number; perUnit: Unit };&#10;&#10;function computeDuty(m: Measure, value: number, quantity: number, fxRate: number): number {&#10;  return m.rate.reduce(&#10;    (sum, c) =&gt;&#10;      c.kind === &#39;ad_valorem&#39; ? sum + value * c.rate : sum + (quantity / c.perUnit.factor) * c.amount * fxRate,&#10;    0,&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>type RateComponent = { kind: 'ad_valorem'; rate: number } | { kind: 'specific'; amount: number; perUnit: Unit };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function computeDuty(m: Measure, value: number, quantity: number, fxRate: number): number {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return m.rate.reduce(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    (sum, c) =></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      c.kind === 'ad_valorem' ? sum + value * c.rate : sum + (quantity / c.perUnit.factor) * c.amount * fxRate,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    0,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>perUnit.factor</code> 是申报单位到法定单位的换算系数，<code>fxRate</code> 是时点汇率，两者都必须来自<strong>有版本、带生效日期的主数据</strong>。这也解释了为什么引擎的输入不止「税率」一个字段：同一表达式在不同 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 下给出不同结果，数量与单位因此是<strong>计算的一等输入</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"mfn-与优惠的对比计算-基线-折扣层与叠加顺序\">MFN 与优惠的对比计算：基线、折扣层与叠加顺序</h2><p>把上面模型落到「MFN vs 优惠」的比较上，正确的抽象是：<strong>先算 MFN 基线税额，再把优惠作为对基线层的一次替换，而不是在所有层上统一打折</strong>。设 MFN 基线税额为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>F</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{MFN}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、协定优惠下税额为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{PREF}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则节省额是</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Savings</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>F</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>F</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>F</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Savings} = D_{MFN} - D_{PREF} = V \\times (r_{MFN} - r_{PREF}) + Q \\times (s_{MFN} - s_{PREF})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Savings</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>对复合税，从价与从量两部分要<strong>分别求差再相加</strong>，不能只比百分数——这正是许多「估算工具」失真的原因：它们只抓从价部分，忽略了从量部分在酒类、糖制品等品类里反而占大头。若该编码还受 Chapter 99 类附加措施约束且不因协定资格豁免，则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{PREF}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 只是优惠栏那一层的值，<strong>最终应缴仍高于它</strong>；因此引擎必须把「优惠税率」与「最终税额」作为两个不同输出，否则会给出过于乐观的报价。</p>\n<p>这道差额还引出一个更根本的建模要求：<strong>税率表必须带时态</strong>。协定关税是分批次降税（staging）的，同一编码在不同年份甚至不同批次适用不同税率；GSP 类自主优惠的产品毕业名单逐年调整；美国 2026 年进入 USMCA 联合审议，汽车规则与劳动价值含量门槛存在被重新谈判的可能。因此税率记录的主键不是「编码 + 国家」，而是**「编码 + 国家 + 措施 + 生效期间」<strong>。一个常被混用的指标是</strong>从价等值（AVE）**：把从量税额除以单位价值折算成等效百分数，仅供跨商品汇总比较，绝不能拿来做单票实际应缴税额。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结-把税率表做成可计算-可追溯的资产\">小结：把税率表做成可计算、可追溯的资产</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>税率是表达式不是数</strong>：从价、从量、复合、Free 四类都必须能求值，从量与复合还需要单位与数量输入。</li>\n<li><strong>完税价格是计算基底</strong>：以欧盟 UCC 第 69–76 条为参照，成交价格法为主，需按第 71/72 条做加计与扣除，不能直接取发票金额。</li>\n<li><strong>结构分四层</strong>：编码 → 措施列（General/Special/Column 2 或 TARIC 的 erga omnes/优惠/反倾销）→ 税率表达式 → 生效条件（General Notes、附加码、配额余额）。</li>\n<li><strong>叠加有顺序</strong>：先算基线层再逐层叠加 Chapter 99 类附加措施，优惠只作用于被授权作用的层；「优惠税率」与「最终税额」必须作为两个输出。</li>\n<li><strong>时态与取数是一等公民</strong>：主键是「编码 + 国家 + 措施 + 生效期间」；税率应以带调用契约、带版本、带缓存策略的接口数据资产形式存在。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一份把上述几层分清的引擎，才能回答业务真正会问的三个问题：这票货<strong>应缴多少</strong>、比走 MFN <strong>省多少</strong>、以及这个结果<strong>依据哪个版本的哪条规则</strong>。第三个问题看似多余，却是事后稽查时唯一替企业说话的证据。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"协定税率表建模与关税计算引擎（MFN vs 优惠、从价/从量/复合税）","id":"协定税率表建模与关税计算引擎-mfn-vs-优惠-从价-从量-复合税"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：税率是表达式，完税价格是它的基底","id":"核心概念-税率是表达式-完税价格是它的基底"},{"level":2,"text":"从完税价格到应缴税额：一条完整的计算链","id":"从完税价格到应缴税额-一条完整的计算链"},{"level":2,"text":"税率表的层级数据模型：列、措施与配额","id":"税率表的层级数据模型-列-措施与配额"},{"level":2,"text":"从量税与复合税的工程难点：单位、汇率与时点","id":"从量税与复合税的工程难点-单位-汇率与时点"},{"level":2,"text":"MFN 与优惠的对比计算：基线、折扣层与叠加顺序","id":"mfn-与优惠的对比计算-基线-折扣层与叠加顺序"},{"level":2,"text":"小结：把税率表做成可计算、可追溯的资产","id":"小结-把税率表做成可计算-可追溯的资产"}],"prev":{"title":"多 FTA 优惠制度图谱与适用条件矩阵（RCEP/USMCA/CPTPP/EU GSP）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/fta-preference-utilization-duty-savings-engineering/preference-regime-comparison-duty-model/multi-fta-preference-regime-taxonomy"},"next":{"title":"协定择优决策与最优税率申报路径——多协定择一、叠加与冲突","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/fta-preference-utilization-duty-savings-engineering/preference-regime-comparison-duty-model/regime-selection-best-rate-sourcing"}}